  "citation": "Crystal-Ornelas R; Varadharajan C; Bond-Lamberty B; Boye K; Burrus M; Cholia S; Crow M; Damerow J; Davarakonda R; Ely K S; Goldman A; Heinz S; Hendrix V; Kakalia Z; Pennington S; Robles E; Rogers A; Simmonds M; Velliquette T; Weierbach H; Weisenhorn P; Welch J N; Agarwal D A (2021): Templates for developing and versioning data standards and reporting formats using GitHub. Environmental Systems Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1780564",
