    "measurementTechnique": [
      "We created these markdown templates based on the results of a systematic review that identified common practices across groups using GitHub for development and versioning of data standard documentation. We created the README file template in markdown so that users of the template can copy and paste the markdown file into their own GitHub repository's README page, and then users can update content based on their on data standard's information. All sub-headings on the README template are based on common practices we located in our review. The GitHub issue templates are customized based on feedback we predicted would be useful for data standard developers. We note that our issue templates are based on examples from other data standard GitHub repositories (e.g., https://github.com/tdwg/dwc/tree/master/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE)."
    ],
